        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wayne Pride, Mel McDaniel, Don Williams\n- Albums: I'm Countryfied\n- Songs: \"Gentle Giant of Country Music\", \"Louisiana Saturday Night\"\n- Topics: opening acts, nicknames, single releases\n\nFacts:\n- In early 2004, Wayne Pride was the opening act for Don Williams.\n- Don Williams was nicknamed the \"Gentle Giant\".\n- Mel McDaniel released the album I'm Countryfied in 1980.\n- \"Louisiana Saturday Night\" was the third single from Mel McDaniel's 1980 album I'm Countryfied.",
